$\\displaystyle =\\sum_{n=3}^{\\infty}\n          \\frac{\\frac{1}{3}\\left[2^n-(-1)^n\\right]}{n!}x^n.$\n        </span>\n      </div>\n\n      <p class=\"indent\">\n        由 $S(x)$ 幂勒级数的唯一性，知\n        $a_n=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left[2^n-(-1)^n\\right]$。\n      </p>\n\n      <section class=\"problem\">\n        <div class=\"matrix-line\">\n          <span class=\"problem-number\">（21）解</span>\n          <span class=\"solution\">（Ⅰ）由已知</span>\n          <span>\n            $A=\\begin{pmatrix}\n            0&amp;-1&amp;-1\\\\\n            -1&amp;0&amp;a\\\\\n            -1&amp;a&amp;0\n            \\end{pmatrix}$\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tail\">与</span>\n          <span>\n            $A^*=\\begin{pmatrix}\n            1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\\n            0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\\n            0&amp;0&amp;b\n            \\end{pmatrix}$\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"tail\">相似，由 $0+0+0=$</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"continuation\">\n          $1+1+b$，知 $b=-2$。故 $A$ 的特征值为\n          $\\lambda_1=\\lambda_2=1,\\lambda_3=-2$。\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"indent\">\n          由 $|E-A|=[illegible]=0$，得\n          $\\alpha_1=(-1,1,0)^{\\mathrm T},\\alpha_2=(1,1,-2)^{\\mathrm T}$（已正交）。\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"indent\">\n          由 $(-2E-A)x=0$，得 $A$ 的特征向量为\n          $\\alpha_3=(1,1,1)^{\\mathrm T}$。将 $\\alpha_1,\\alpha_2,\\alpha_3$ 单位化，得\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"eigenvectors\">\n          $\\displaystyle\n          \\gamma_1=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}(-1,1,0)^{\\mathrm T},\\quad\n          \\gamma_2=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt6}(1,1,-2)^{\\mathrm T},\\quad\n          \\gamma_3=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt3}(1,1,1)^{\\mathrm T}.\n          $\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"q-line\">\n          <span class=\"prefix\">令 $Q=(\\gamma_1,\\gamma_2,\\gamma_3)=$</span>\n          <span>\n            $\\displaystyle\n            \\begin{pmatrix}\n            -\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}&amp;\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n            \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2}&amp;\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}\\\\\n            0&amp;-\\dfrac{2}{\\sqrt6}&amp;\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}\n            \\end{pmatrix}\n            $\n          </span>\n          <span class=\"suffix\">，则 $Q$ 为所求正交矩阵，标准形为 $y_1^2+y_2^2-2y_3^2$。</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"part-two\">\n          （Ⅱ）由于 $x^{\\mathrm T}x=y^{\\mathrm T}y=1$，即在\n          $y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2=1$ 的条件下，\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"display-line\">\n          $\\displaystyle\n          f(x_1,x_2,x_3)=x^{\\mathrm T}Ax\n          =y_1^2+y_2^2-2y_3^2\n          =y_1^2+y_2^2+y_3^2-3y_3^2\n          =1-3y_3^2,\n          $\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"conclusion\">\n          所以 $f(x_1,x_2,x_3)$ 在 $x^{\\mathrm T}x=1$ 的条件下的最大值为 $1$，最小值为 $-2$。\n        </p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"problem-22\">\n        <p class=\"density-intro\">\n          <span class=\"problem-number\">（22）解</span>\n          <span class=\"solution\">（Ⅰ）先求 $f(x)$。解方程\n          $f'(x)+\\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}f(x)=0$，得\n          $f(x)=ce^{-\\frac{x}{\\lambda}}$（$c$ 为大于零</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"integral-line\">\n          的常数）。由\n          $\\displaystyle\\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty}f(x)\\,dx\n          =\\int_0^{+\\infty}ce^{-\\frac{x}{\\lambda}}\\,dx=1$，\n          得 $c=\\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}$，故\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"piecewise\">\n          $\\displaystyle\n          f(x)=\n          \\begin{cases}\n          \\dfrac{1}{\\lambda}e^{-\\frac{x}{\\lambda}},&amp;x&gt;0,\\\\\n          0,&amp;x\\leqslant0.\n          \\end{cases}\n          $\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
